OL,3,GNEWSAIs Bristol behind Gloucester
OL,4,ADocks' silt crisis?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's docks' silt levels have become
OL,7,Fso high over the summer months that
OL,8,Fmultiple boats have become trapped as
OL,9,Ftheir drivers have attempted to sail
OL,10,Fthrough.
OL,12,FThere have been growing suspicions
OL,13,Famong locals that the crisis has
OL,14,Fpartially been caused by water being
OL,15,Fpumped out of Gloucester's canal to
OL,16,Fsupply drinking water to people in
OL,17,FBristol.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
