OL,3,GNEWSAIs Bristol behind Gloucester
OL,4,ADocks' silt crisis?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut leaders at the Canal & Rivers Trust
OL,7,F(CRT), which manages the Gloucester and
OL,8,FSharpness Canal, said the reason for
OL,9,Fthis year's unusually high levels is
OL,10,Fcomplex, caused by multiple factors.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the charity said the
OL,13,Fsecond phase of its #4m dredging
OL,14,Fprogramme will begin later this month.
